---
import PageLayout from "../../../components/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout lang="zh" active="download" title="下载 — Linxira OS">
    <a href="/zh/" class="back">← 返回首页</a>
    <h1>下载 Linxira OS</h1>
    <p>当前为<b>2026.09.29</b>——引导器修复轮（rEFInd 可选可装、systemd-boot 校验修复），并首次随系统附带<b>官方手册</b>（linxira-wiki）与<b>工作区守护</b>。</p>

    <div class="dl-card">
      <h3>linxira-2026.09.29-x86_64.iso</h3>
      <div class="meta">4.8 GB · 桌面/服务器安装镜像 · x86_64</div>
      <a class="dl-btn" href="https://gitcode.com/BOHUYESHAN-APB/Linxira-os" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开 GitCode 仓库下载 →</a>
      <a class="dl-btn ghost" href="https://gitcode.com/BOHUYESHAN-APB/Linxira-os/src/master/linxira-2026.09.29-x86_64.iso" target="_blank" rel="noopener">直达 ISO 文件页</a>
      <p style="margin-top:0.8rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:#64748b;">GitCode 仓库内点击 ISO 文件 → 下载按钮（大文件走 Git LFS，国内访问快）。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dl-card">
      <h3>linxira-wsl-2026.09.29-x86_64.tar.gz</h3>
      <div class="meta">约 487 MB · WSL2 发行版（纯 CLI 工具链 + WSLg 图形工具）· x86_64</div>
      <a class="dl-btn" href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-wsl/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Releases 下载 →</a>
      <p style="margin-top:0.8rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:#64748b;">导入方式：<code>wsl --import linxira C:\wsldata linxira-wsl-2026.09.29-x86_64.tar.gz --version 2</code>，随后 <code>wsl -d linxira</code>。systemd 已启用；SHA256 见 Release 附件。</p>
    </div>

    <h2>校验和</h2>
    <pre><code>sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS

# SHA256 (linxira-2026.09.29-x86_64.iso):
174acbe2e47bcd298fa3ad05b0e5994e7c6325f4a2c70df2c31ae4be9e873ad6  linxira-2026.09.29-x86_64.iso

# WSL 镜像校验和见 GitHub Release 附件 *.sha256</code></pre>

    <h2>安装</h2>
    <p>参考 <a href="/zh/docs/install/" style="color:#20B8B0;">安装指南</a>：制作启动盘、安装时在「桌面环境」一步选择 <strong>KDE Plasma</strong>、<strong>COSMIC</strong>、<strong>服务器（无桌面）</strong>或<strong>服务器（最小 · 纯 Arch）</strong>。</p>

    <div class="note">
      <p>说明：ISO 为聚合作品——内核 GPL-2.0-only、系统组件各自许可证、自研工具 MIT/GPL-3.0。ISO 校验和文件（SHA256SUMS）与 ISO 一同存放在 GitCode 仓库；WSL 镜像存放在 linxira-wsl 仓库 Release。</p>
    </div>
<style>
    h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; color: #20B8B0; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.8rem; }
    li { color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    pre { background: #0a0f1a; border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; overflow-x: auto; margin: 1rem 0; }
    pre code { background: none; color: #cbd5e1; padding: 0; }
    .dl-card { background: rgba(30,41,59,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(32,184,176,0.3); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .dl-card h3 { color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .dl-card .meta { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .dl-btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); color: white; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.8rem 2rem; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0.3rem 0.5rem 0.3rem 0; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
    .dl-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(32,184,176,0.35); text-decoration: none; }
    .dl-btn.ghost { background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.8); color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 500; }
    .dl-btn.ghost:hover { border-color: #20B8B0; color: #20B8B0; }
    .note { background: rgba(32,184,176,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(32,184,176,0.25); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; margin: 1.2rem 0; }
    .note p { color: #cbd5e1; margin: 0; }
  </style>
</PageLayout>
